# After the Sparring Master falls (Milestone 20b, escape start). Plays when the
# Monastery reloads after the fight; then the map fades out to the overworld.

spawn frank frank at ~-1,0 facing right
face player left
emote frank note
say Frank: Ha! Down it goes! I've never seen hands move like yours, monk.
say Frank: Listen - I heard the guards talking. They took three others like you. Souls that still shine clean, the ones the Unraveling can't turn.
say Frank: So Vorath's people lock them away instead. One is held in {next}, {next_where}.
emote player !
say Ryn: Then we go and get them. All three.
say Frank: Verdance first - the village west of here. You need rest, and I need to see what's left of my stock. Come on - fresh air!
fade out 1
